{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "kevin_greet",
   "topic": "打个招呼",
   "speaker": "kevin",
   "requires": [],
   "grants": [],
   "text": "你醒了？停电把保险烧了，别担心。桌上还有吃的。",
   "replies": [
    {
     "text": "外面那栋房子怎么亮着灯？",
     "goto": "kevin_far_house"
    },
    {
     "text": "没事，我随便看看。",
     "goto": null
    }
   ],
   "variants": [
    {
     "when": {
      "world": "world_beta"
     },
     "text": "这地方……好像有点不太一样。你感觉到了吗？"
    },
    {
     "when": {
      "world": "world_gamma"
     },
     "text": "不对，真的不对。这屋子的光变了。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "kevin_far_house",
   "speaker": "kevin",
   "requires": [],
   "grants": [
    "fact_far_house"
   ],
   "text": "那栋？大概是发电机吧。街上就我们两家，别多想。",
   "replies": [
    {
     "text": "「就两家」……你确定吗？",
     "goto": "kevin_two_houses"
    },
    {
     "text": "好。",
     "goto": null
    }
   ],
   "variants": [
    {
     "when": {
      "said": [
       "kevin_far_house"
      ]
     },
     "text": "远处那栋房子？我说过了，它一直在那里。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "kevin_two_houses",
   "speaker": "kevin",
   "requires": [
    "fact_far_house"
   ],
   "grants": [
    "fact_two_houses"
   ],
   "text": "当然。左边我们家，右边Hugh和Laurie上个月买的。怎么了？",
   "replies": [
    {
     "text": "没什么。",
     "goto": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "kevin_sticky",
   "topic": "问门上的便签",
   "speaker": "kevin",
   "requires": [
    "fact_sticky_note"
   ],
   "grants": [
    "fact_kevin_denies_sticky"
   ],
   "text": "便签？什么便签？我没在门上贴过东西。",
   "replies": [
    {
     "text": "上面写着一个数字。",
     "goto": "kevin_number"
    },
    {
     "text": "那可能我记错了。",
     "goto": null
    }
   ],
   "fires": [
    "evt_sticky_discussed"
   ],
   "teaches_npc": [
    "fact_player_told_sticky"
   ],
   "variants": [
    {
     "when": {
      "said": [
       "kevin_sticky"
      ]
     },
     "text": "我们刚才不是说过了吗？门上那张便签，你也注意到了。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "kevin_number",
   "speaker": "kevin",
   "requires": [
    "fact_sticky_note"
   ],
   "grants": [
    "fact_number_matters"
   ],
   "text": "……等一下。我这里也有一张。我写的是 1，你那张是几？",
   "replies": [
    {
     "text": "我得再去看一眼。",
     "goto": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "mike_greet",
   "topic": "打个招呼",
   "speaker": "mike",
   "requires": [],
   "grants": [],
   "text": "嘿，过来坐。彗星今晚会很近，可能一辈子就这一次。",
   "replies": [
    {
     "text": "你注意到街对面那栋房子了吗？",
     "goto": "mike_far_house"
    },
    {
     "text": "我先转转。",
     "goto": null
    }
   ],
   "variants": [
    {
     "when": {
      "world": "world_beta"
     },
     "text": "这地方……好像有点不太一样。你感觉到了吗？"
    },
    {
     "when": {
      "world": "world_gamma"
     },
     "text": "不对，真的不对。这屋子的光变了。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "mike_far_house",
   "speaker": "mike",
   "requires": [],
   "grants": [
    "fact_far_house"
   ],
   "text": "注意到了。奇怪的是——我数了数，那栋房子的窗户亮着，可我们这边全黑了。",
   "replies": [
    {
     "text": "你觉得那可能是我们自己的房子吗？",
     "goto": "mike_mirror"
    },
    {
     "text": "只是灯没坏而已。",
     "goto": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "mike_mirror",
   "speaker": "mike",
   "requires": [
    "fact_far_house"
   ],
   "grants": [
    "fact_identity_doubt"
   ],
   "text": "你别吓我。你是说……那栋房子长得跟我们一模一样？",
   "replies": [
    {
     "text": "我出去看看。",
     "goto": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "mike_dark",
   "topic": "问那段黑路",
   "speaker": "mike",
   "requires": [
    "fact_dark_road"
   ],
   "grants": [
    "fact_mike_warns_dark"
   ],
   "text": "你走过那段黑路了？别再走了。你回来的时候……有点不对劲。",
   "replies": [
    {
     "text": "什么不对劲？",
     "goto": "mike_wrong"
    },
    {
     "text": "你想多了。",
     "goto": null
    }
   ],
   "variants": [
    {
     "when": {
      "npc_knows": [
       "fact_player_told_sticky"
      ]
     },
     "text": "那段黑路我也走过。Kevin 说门上有张便签？也许和这事有关。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "mike_wrong",
   "speaker": "mike",
   "requires": [
    "fact_dark_road"
   ],
   "grants": [
    "fact_mike_notices_change"
   ],
   "text": "Beth 说她十分钟前刚擦过那张桌子。可那杯子是干的。",
   "replies": [
    {
     "text": "……我去问她。",
     "goto": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "lee_greet",
   "topic": "问屋子的异样",
   "speaker": "lee",
   "requires": [],
   "grants": [],
   "text": "……你有没有觉得，屋子有点不对？",
   "replies": [
    {
     "text": "你也注意到了？",
     "goto": "lee_agree"
    },
    {
     "text": "哪里不对？",
     "goto": "lee_detail"
    }
   ],
   "variants": [
    {
     "when": {
      "world": "world_beta"
     },
     "text": "这地方……好像有点不太一样。你感觉到了吗？"
    },
    {
     "when": {
      "world": "world_gamma"
     },
     "text": "不对，真的不对。这屋子的光变了。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "lee_agree",
   "speaker": "lee",
   "requires": [],
   "grants": [
    "fact_lee_agrees"
   ],
   "text": "东西的位置在变。我不说，是怕大家慌。但你注意到了就好。",
   "replies": [
    {
     "text": "我会留意。",
     "goto": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "lee_detail",
   "speaker": "lee",
   "requires": [],
   "grants": [
    "fact_object_moved"
   ],
   "text": "那把椅子。刚才还在窗边。现在在桌旁。没人动过它。",
   "replies": [
    {
     "text": "我记下了。",
     "goto": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "lee_dark",
   "topic": "说说黑路之后的发现",
   "speaker": "lee",
   "requires": [
    "fact_dark_road",
    "fact_identity_doubt"
   ],
   "grants": [
    "fact_lee_deep"
   ],
   "text": "你穿过黑路以后，我数了数。我们还是八个人。可我记得你刚才不在屋里。",
   "replies": [
    {
     "text": "你的意思是……",
     "goto": "lee_conclusion"
    },
    {
     "text": "别说了。",
     "goto": null
    }
   ],
   "variants": [
    {
     "when": {
      "relationship_at_least": {
       "target": "player",
       "trust": 0.3
      }
     },
     "text": "说实话吧——那段黑路之后，我看到了不该看到的东西。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "lee_conclusion",
   "speaker": "lee",
   "requires": [
    "fact_lee_deep"
   ],
   "grants": [
    "fact_second_emily"
   ],
   "text": "我的意思是：现在屋里的那个「你」，可能不是跟我一起进屋的那个。",
   "replies": [
    {
     "text": "……我需要一个人静静。",
     "goto": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "beth_greet",
   "topic": "打个招呼",
   "speaker": "beth",
   "requires": [],
   "grants": [],
   "text": "要吃点什么吗？厨房还有沙拉。别管那些男人，他们说来说去都是那点事。",
   "replies": [
    {
     "text": "这桌子你刚擦过？",
     "goto": "beth_table"
